{"story":{"id":"event-ancrel-6150","title":{"zh":"屏障星球","en":"Shielded Planet"},"category":"precursors","kind":"event","image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","start":"ancrel.6150","chapters":10,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"最近的调查显示，[From.GetName]被包围在了一个拥有难以置信的强度并反射所有探测手段的护盾之中。这个星球护盾似乎是从这颗星球附近的卫星中产生的。","en":"As confirmed by its recent survey, [From.GetName] is surrounded by an incredibly strong energy field that deflects all attempts to scan it. The field appears to be generated from the planet's nearby moon."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"ancrel.6150","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"CURIOUS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1213"},"children":["n3","n4","n5"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.6155","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:247"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.6160","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:253"},"children":[]},"n5":{"doc":"ancrel.6165","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:259"},"children":["n6"]},"n6":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_2","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"CURIOUS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1340"},"children":["n7","n8","n9","n10"]},"n7":{"doc":"ancrel.6170","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:286"},"children":[]},"n8":{"doc":"ancrel.6175","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:292"},"children":[]},"n9":{"doc":"ancrel.6180","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:298"},"children":[]},"n10":{"doc":"ancrel.6185","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:304"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"ancrel.6150","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"屏障星球","en":"Shielded Planet"},"texts":[{"zh":"最近的调查显示，[From.GetName]被包围在了一个拥有难以置信的强度并反射所有探测手段的护盾之中。这个星球护盾似乎是从这颗星球附近的卫星中产生的。","en":"As confirmed by its recent survey, [From.GetName] is surrounded by an incredibly strong energy field that deflects all attempts to scan it. The field appears to be generated from the planet's nearby moon."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURIOUS","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:1213","story":"event-ancrel-6150"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt","line":1171},"sets":["minigalaxy_site_spawned"],"names":{"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"archaeological_site_types:site_minigalaxy_1","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"卫星基地","en":"Moon Base"},"texts":[{"zh":"在这颗卫星上的一个大陨石坑内，可以找到一座大型基地建筑群的遗迹。它已经被遗弃了几千年之久。围绕着附近行星的能量屏障似乎是源于这个古老的基地正下方的一个能量源。","en":"Ruins of a large base complex of some kind can be found inside a large crater on this moon. It must have been abandoned thousands of years ago. The energy barrier that encompasses the nearby planet appears to originate from a source directly beneath this ancient base."}],"sections":[{"zh":"在这颗卫星上的一个大陨石坑内，可以找到一座大型基地建筑群的遗迹。它已经被遗弃了几千年之久。围绕着附近行星的能量屏障似乎是源于这个古老的基地正下方的一个能量源。","en":"Ruins of a large base complex of some kind can be found inside a large crater on this moon. It must have been abandoned thousands of years ago. The energy barrier that encompasses the nearby planet appears to originate from a source directly beneath this ancient base."}],"image":"art/d63f9361bc2bc9cdd5ab.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6155","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:247","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.6160","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:253","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.6165","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:259","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6150"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29557","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29557","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29557","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},